                                "sense_id": "13f2483b-b3e6-3261-8936-aa2f329f41c6",
                                "text": "Having considered the aforementioned general principles and measured the improprieties of the Crown’s opening against those of the other cases noted above, I decided not to mistry this case, but, rather, to issue a corrective instruction."
