                                "sense_id": "f1543c12-17c1-3060-8c01-459a399c3cdf",
                                "text": "...Ms. Masrour was informed by a judge that the defendant in a matter before the court raised the issue of the quality of Mr. Dhir’s interpretation. She was unaware as to whether the case mistried but she took steps to switch interpreters."
